# --- Task 1 (2026-10-23): macshell + theming ----------------------------------
# Shell (MIT, 246 stars, push verificado 2026-10-23T02:26:59Z via GitHub API):
#   repo:    https://github.com/0-ss/MacShell
#   ref:     main @ d930ba7604f0d22e8b2705223f92f614412323b0 (2026-10-27, v0.4.2)
#   deps:    Quickshell>=0.3.2 (extra: 0.3.2), Qt>=6.8 (extra: 6.12),
#            Hyprland>=0.55 Lua (cachyos: 0.56.2)
#   install: install.sh -> ~/.config/quickshell/{MacShell,MacLock},
#            ~/.local/bin/{macshell-start,macshell-update}; autostart
#            hyprland.lua (hl.on hyprland.start) o exec-once=macshell (.conf)
# Iconos recomendados upstream (GPL-3.0, 14 stars, push 2026-09-25):
#   repo:    https://github.com/Scrimas/MacOS-Like
#   install: manual post-ISO (sin paquete repo-nativo; lo hace Task 5)
# GTK (instalacion via AUR/chaotic; WhiteSur-cursors sin paquete verificado):
#   https://github.com/vinceliuice/WhiteSur-gtk-theme  (MIT, 9369 stars)
#   https://github.com/vinceliuice/WhiteSur-icon-theme (GPL-3.0, 2102 stars)
# GRUB (placeholder, fichero .src en nimbus-overlay/etc/nimbus/theming/):
#   https://github.com/vinceliuice/grub-themes (variante Whitesur)
# SDDM auditado Task 1 (MIT, 29 stars, push 2026-07-25, el mas maduro
#   de estilo macOS encontrado 2026-10-23; resto <=16 stars o abandonados):
#   repo:    https://github.com/xCaptaiN09/echo-sddm (branch master)
#   estado:  PLACEHOLDER (.example inactivo para no romper base CachyOS;
#            Task 5 decide inclusion final tras prueba QEMU)
# Fondos/paleta canonicos (Task 1 define, Task 4 reutiliza):
#   wallpaper: /usr/share/backgrounds/nimbus/sequoia-light.jpg
#   paleta:    claro #F5F5F7 / oscuro #1D1D1F / acento #007AFF
#   fuente:    Inter (extra: inter-font 4.1-1)

# --- Task 2 (2026-10-23): laptop power + GPU hibrida + VA-API + ZRAM ---------
# Decisiones: auto-cpufreq (cachyos, NO power-profiles-daemon),
# PRIME RTD3 nativo (NO supergfxctl/envycontrol), zram-generator+zstd.
# Overlay: etc/auto-cpufreq.conf (charger performance/balance_performance,
#   battery powersave/balance_power), etc/udev/rules.d/80-nvidia-pm.rules
#   (power/control=auto, PCI 10de), etc/modprobe.d/nvidia-pm.conf
#   (NVreg_DynamicPowerManagement=0x02 + nvidia-drm modeset=1),
#   etc/systemd/zram-generator.conf (zstd, min(ram/2,8192), prio 100),
#   etc/sysctl.d/99-vm-zram-parameters.conf (swappiness=180).
# Paquetes (extra/cachyos, append Task2): auto-cpufreq thermald
#   zram-generator nvidia-dkms nvidia-utils lib32-nvidia-utils nvidia-prime
#   switcheroo-control mesa vulkan-radeon vulkan-intel vulkan-mesa-layers
#   lib32-vulkan-mesa-layers libva libva-utils vdpauinfo libvdpau-va-gl
#   intel-media-driver libva-intel-driver libvpl vpl-gpu-rt ffmpeg
#   gst-plugins-bad mpv vlc nvtop libva-nvidia-driver.
# Excluidos (auditoria, NO anadir): power-profiles-daemon tuned-ppd tlp
#   bumblebee optimus-manager xf86-video-intel.

# --- Task 3 (2026-10-23): tienda unica pamac + Flathub + plug&play -----------
# Decision vinculante: pamac-gtk + libpamac-flatpak-plugin + appstream +
#   archlinux-appstream-data + flatpak + xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland +
#   base-devel git polkit-gnome. Descartados: vinifmor/bauh (abandonado
#   0.10.7 Ene-2024), Discover (sin AUR por diseno, PackageKit lock).
#   Upstream tienda: https://github.com/manjaro/pamac
#   Flathub: https://dl.flathub.org/repo/flathub.flatpakrepo
# Overlay: etc/pamac.conf.d/nimbus.conf (EnableFlatpak/EnableAUR=true;
#   fusion a /etc/pamac.conf la hace usr/bin/nimbus-live-setup, Task 5),
#   etc/skel/.config/hypr/10-shortcuts.conf (SUPER+SPACE spotlight,
#   ALT+TAB switcher MacShell via qs ipc), exec-once polkit-agent + udiskie en
#   hyprland.conf. Cero binds CTRL-*.
# Paquetes USB (extra): udisks2 udiskie gvfs gvfs-mtp ntfs-3g exfatprogs
#   dosfstools mtools nautilus.
# AUR: hyprshell (https://github.com/H3rmt/hyprshell; fallback cyclenext).

# --- Task 4 (2026-10-23): calamares estilo Setup Assistant --------------------
# Base: CachyOS/cachyos-calamares (GPL-3.0), ejemplo fancy/ (slideshowAPI 2).
# Overlay: etc/calamares/settings.conf (branding nimbus; show
#   welcome,locale,keyboard,partition,users,summary; exec 18 modulos
#   partition..umount; show finished), branding/nimbus/ (branding.desc
#   1024x640, sidebar widget, paleta #F5F5F7/#1D1D1F/#007AFF, SVG
#   placeholders nimbus-logo.svg/productWelcome.svg, show.qml 3 slides
#   Hello primero, stylesheet.qss), modules/ (partition.conf erase default
#   sin manual, EFI 512MiB, btrfs default; users.conf wheel bash sin root;
#   displaymanager.conf greetd+hyprland).

# --- Task 5 (2026-10-23): perfil archiso + build reproducible + QEMU ---------
# Upstream perfil (verificado 2026-10-23 via git ls-remote + clone --depth 1):
#   repo:   https://github.com/CachyOS/CachyOS-Live-ISO
#   rama:   master (sin tags publicados)
#   UPSTREAM_COMMIT=3215497d2e8c5fea90e185affcf973dfa2cf790b
#   commit: 3215497d2e8c5fea90e185affcf973dfa2cf790b (2026-10-03,
#             "Replace nvidia-module-loader with cachyos-drm-awaiter")
#   perfil: archiso/profiledef.sh (iso_name=cachyos -> build lo renombra a
#             nimbus; packages_desktop.x86_64 ~201 pkgs, linux-cachyos,
#             airootfs/etc/skel; file_permissions upstream para shadow/
#             gshadow/root/polkit/sudoers + /usr/local/bin/* 0755)
# Build: ./build_iso.sh (7 pasos: check_deps pin setup_keys get_upstream
#   apply_overlay build verify). SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH=$(git log -1 --format=%ct)
#   del repo NimbusOS. Solape append-vs-upstream filtrado al concatenar
#   (dosfstools exfatprogs mesa mtools noto-fonts ntfs-3g nvidia-utils ya en
#   perfil CachyOS; lista en out/skipped-dupes.txt).
# Test: ./scripts/test-qemu.sh (qemu-img 20G + qemu-system-x86_64 kvm q35
#   cpu host smp4 4G OVMF virtio-vga-gl sdl,gl acpi-battery boot order=d).
#   Pre-check lscpu AVX2 (x86-64-v3) o abortar.
# Pins MacShell: 0-ss/MacShell main @ d930ba7 (2026-10-27, v0.4.2). Parches Nimbus (proponer aguas arriba): guarda CanSuspend en sleepMachine; menuModelFor sin atajos ciegos (solo acciones reales).
